@startuml
!include ../_theme.puml
title COMP-SEQ01 UC01 用户服务组件顺序图
autonumber
actor 用户 as U
participant "Web 前端" as UI
participant "API Gateway" as GW
participant "认证管理" as AUTH
participant "资料管理" as PROFILE
U -> UI: 提交注册/登录/资料操作
UI -> GW: HTTP 请求
alt 注册或登录
  GW -> AUTH: register/login
  AUTH --> GW: JWT 与用户资料/失败原因
else 修改资料
  GW -> AUTH: validateToken
  AUTH --> GW: userId/401
  opt 身份有效
    GW -> PROFILE: updateProfile(userId, patch)
    PROFILE --> GW: 最新资料/校验失败
  end
end
GW --> UI: 操作结果
UI --> U: 显示结果
@enduml
